    "stable_id": "parity-gcd-lemma",
    "canonical_statement": "For all positive integers a, b, c, if a^2 + b^2 = c^2 and gcd(a,b,c) = 1, then exactly one of a and b is even, c is odd, and gcd(a,b) = gcd(a,c) = gcd(b,c) = 1.",
